From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] msxml3: IXSLProcessor getters, start mode, reset; specified/parsed; document type node

msxml3: IXSLTemplate/IXSLProcessor getters, start mode, reset, readyState; specified/parsed; document type node

IXSLTemplate::stylesheet, IXSLProcessor input / ownerTemplate / stylesheet
return what was set. startMode / setStartMode / startModeURI are kept per
processor and the transform really starts in that mode (libxslt's
transform-context mode), together with any parameters. reset drops the last
result; readyState reports LOADING / LOADED / COMPLETE. transform without
input fails instead of crashing.

IXMLDOMNode::specified and ::parsed no longer log a FIXME and return
E_INVALIDARG for a NULL pointer on every node type. The document type node
implements its read-only members (nodeValue, parentNode, first/last child,
siblings, attributes, hasChildNodes, ownerDocument, nodeTypeString, text, xml,
namespaceURI, prefix, baseName, specified, parsed).
